<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Aug 1-14 direct investment put at $941 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil Aug 1-14 direct investment put at $941 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign direct investmnent into Brazil between Aug 1-14 reached $941 million, Central Bank Economic Department Chief Altamir Lopes said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said foreign direct investment in the year to the end of July stood at $8.804 billion versus $9.889 billion for all of 1996.</p>
<p>((--Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 5561 3141193))</p>
